    "proximate_text": "a \"system fault reset\" was performed in April 2025 when EHC1 was electrically and mechanically isolated due to degradation, which removed the EHC2 \"run-to-failure\" status. With that protection blocked, when EHC2 deviated on September 14, 2025 it automatically turned off, causing all turbine MCVs to fully open and turbine power to increase uncontrollably, leading to a manual reactor trip.",
